  "prefLabel": "Rev 810.02 Interest",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 810.02 Interest.\n\n(a) A declaration of consideration required to be filed with the department under RSA 78-B shall be considered a return and subject to interest under RSA 21-J:28.\n\n(b) Interest shall be paid to the department.\n\nSource. #8579, eff 3-8-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by #14071, eff 9-10-24\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev800.html"
